OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly and bright start to
OL,6,FWednesday, but becoming increasingly
OL,7,Fcloudy and mild through the morning,
OL,8,Fthough most areas remaining dry. Winds
OL,9,Fwill steadily strengthen through the
OL,10,Fday, becoming strong by the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy, windy and mild
OL,13,Fovernight, with a few outbreaks of
OL,14,Frain, most likely across northern
OL,15,Fparts of the region, where they may
OL,16,Fbecome persistent towards dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
