OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FCloudy and windy Thursday,
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain affecting the
OL,7,Fregion for much of the day before
OL,8,Fclearing southeastwards during the
OL,9,Fevening. Winds will gradually ease
OL,10,Flater in the day.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCooler
OL,13,Fthrough this period, with sunny spells
OL,14,Fand showers. Showers most frequent
OL,15,Fnear the coast, though occasionally
OL,16,Fspreading inland. Winds mostly light,
OL,17,Fbut breezy at times near coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
